%% M2 key flow 2: parcel-service validates an issued quote before booking.
%% GET /api/v1/pricing/quotes/{quoteId} - requires a bearer token.
%% The response is derived only from the stored snapshot; request data is never
%% substituted into it, and expiry is indistinguishable from a guessed identifier.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as parcel-service (M3)
    participant GW as api-gateway
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant QC as QuoteController
    participant QLS as QuoteLookupService
    participant CL as Clock (injected)
    participant RD as RedisQuoteStore

    Note over P: CreateParcelRequest carries the quoteId<br/>the customer was shown
    P->>GW: GET /api/v1/pricing/quotes/{quoteId}<br/>Authorization: Bearer ...
    GW->>KC: validate the JWT against the JWKS
    alt token missing or invalid
        GW-->>P: 401
    else token valid
        GW->>QC: forward
        QC->>QLS: get(quoteId)
        QLS->>RD: findById(quoteId)
        alt no snapshot under that key
            RD-->>QLS: empty
            QLS-->>QC: ResourceNotFoundException
            QC-->>P: 404 problem+json QUOTE_NOT_FOUND
        else snapshot found
            RD-->>QLS: QuoteSnapshot
            QLS->>QLS: snapshot.quoteId equals the requested id?
            QLS->>CL: instant()
            alt now is not before expiresAt
                QLS-->>QC: ResourceNotFoundException
                QC-->>P: 404 problem+json QUOTE_NOT_FOUND
                Note over QLS,P: deliberately the same answer as "unknown",<br/>so expiry leaks nothing
            else still valid
                QLS-->>QC: the stored snapshot, verbatim
                QC-->>P: 200 fee, breakdown, zones, districts, weight,<br/>size class, service level, COD, issuedAt, expiresAt
                Note over P: the booking is persisted with the fee<br/>the customer was actually quoted
            end
        end
    end
